        .{ .source = "==Persana==\n\n===<span class=\"icone\">[[Image:Nuvola apps bookcase.svg|30px|link=Fanoroana:Etimôlôjia|Fiaviana ary tantaran'i « کاربرد »]]</span>&nbsp;Etimôlôjia===\n:persana ''کار<tr:kâr><t:work>'' + ''برد<tr:bord><pos:past stem of <i class=\"Arab fa-Arab mention\" lang=\"fa\">[[:بردن#Persian|بردن]]</i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"fa-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">bordan</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to carry</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>>''.\n===[[Image:Open book 01.svg|30px|link=help:karazan-teny]] Anarana iombonana [[sokajy:persana]][[Catégorie:Anarana iombonana amin'ny teny persana]]===\n'''کاربرد''' \n# [[fampiasana]], [[fampiharana]]\n#* ''کاربردهای هوش مصنوعی''\n\n====<span title=\"Fampahalalàna ara-peo an'ilay teny کاربرد\">[[Image:Nuvola apps edu languages.svg|30px|link=help:fanononana]] Fanononana</span>==== \n* <div class=\"vsSwitcher\" data-toggle-category=\"pronunciations\" style=\"width: 42em; max-width:100%;\"><span class=\"vsToggleElement\" style=\"float: right;\">&nbsp;</span>\n<div class=\"vsShow\" style=\"display:none\">\n* <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">[[w:Dari Persian|Dari, formal]]</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> [[Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]]<sup>([[Appendix:Persian pronunciation|key]])</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kʰɑːɾ.bʊ́ɹd̪]</span>[[Category:Persian terms with IPA pronunciation|کاربرد]]</div>\n<div class=\"vsHide\">\n* <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">[[w:Dari Persian|Dari, formal]]</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> [[Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]]<sup>([[Appendix:Persian pronunciation|key]])</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kʰɑːɾ.bʊ́ɹd̪]</span>[[Category:Persian terms with IPA pronunciation|کاربرد]]\n** <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">[[w:Dari#South-Eastern|Kabuli]]</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> [[Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]]<sup>([[Appendix:Persian pronunciation|key]])</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kʰɑːɾ.bʊ́ɹd̪]</span>[[Category:Persian terms with IPA pronunciation|کاربرد]]\n** <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">[[w:Hazaragi dialect|Hazaragi]]</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> [[Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]]<sup>([[Appendix:Persian pronunciation|key]])</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kʰɔːɾ.búɹd̪̥]</span>[[Category:Persian terms with IPA pronunciation|کاربرد]]</div></div>\n<div>\n* <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">[[w:Iranian Persian|Iran, formal]]</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> [[Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]]<sup>([[Appendix:Persian pronunciation|key]])</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[kʰɒːɹ.bóɹd̪̥]</span>[[Category:Persian terms with IPA pronunciation|کاربرد]]</div>\n<span></span>\n{|class=\"fa-IPA mw-collapsed mw-collapsible\" \n! colspan=\"2\" |Readings\n|- \n\n|-\n! Dari reading<sup><small>[[Wiktionary:Persian transliteration/Classical|?]]</small></sup>\n|kārburd\n|-\n! Iranian reading<sup><small>[[Wiktionary:Persian transliteration/Iranian|?]]</small></sup>\n|kârbord\n|-\n\n|}<templatestyles src=\"Template:fa-IPA/style.css\" />\n\n<h3><span title=\"Teny na fomba fiteny mifandraika amin'i « کاربرد »\">Teny mifandraika</span></h3>\n* [[به کار بردن]]\n* [[کاربردی]]\n\n<h4>[[File:Books-aj.svg aj ashton 01f.svg|35px|link=Wiktionary:Tsiahy]] Tsiahy</h4>\n* Ity pejy ity dia nadika avy amin'ny pejy [[:en:کاربرد|کاربرد]] tao amin'ny Wikibolana amin'ny t